<title>USA: Value Health to Spin Off ValueRx.</title>
<headline>Value Health to Spin Off ValueRx.</headline>
<dateline>AVON, Conn. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Value Health Inc said Wednesday its board of directors had approved plans to spin off ValueRx, its prescription benefit and medication management company, to shareholders.</p>
<p>The company said the board also passed plans to acquire a workers' compensation managed care company as well as institute an open market share repurchase program of up to $100 million.</p>
<p>The plans are part of a major restructuring designed to increase shareholder value, it added.</p>
